OL,3,AWilliam and Catherine visit Bute and
OL,4,AKing opens AI summit as row erupts over
OL,5,ADiana book
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King warns of the "existential
OL,8,Fdangers" of AI falling into the wrong
OL,9,Fhands as he opens a summit in Ayrshire,
OL,10,FScotland
OL,12,FIn opening remarks, he says AI's powers
OL,13,Fcould potentially be used in
OL,14,F"catastrophic ways" and this means
OL,15,Fsufficient controls are needed "before
OL,16,Fit is all too late"
OL,18,FImages show the monarch speaking to
OL,19,Ftech figures, including Nvidia boss
OL,20,FJensen Huang
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
